 questions, and preserves all producer namespaces and supersession evidence append-only.\n\nDeterministic comparison produced 71 exact `verified_agreement`, 145 checker disagreements, and 8 maker safe rejections. Independent source-bound resolvers covered all 153 non-agreement rows under the frozen shard identities, including the zero-work shard and the separately authenticated safe-rejection replacement namespace. Terminal conservation is:\n\n`224 = 153 resolver_verified + 71 verified_agreement + 0 safe_rejection + 0 conflict + 0 unresolved`\n\nOnly `verified_agreement` and `resolver_verified` records enter the artifact-only verified structural staging shard. The implementation adds exact source/hash custody, false-accept and false-override audits, topology validation, deterministic reconstruction, immutable-history/no-special-case evidence, and an artifact manifest. It performs no semantic, KG, canonical, production, public, or downstream writes.\n\nExact-head review corrections are additive:\n\n- Batch015 loads structural, activation, reconcile, and finalizer runtimes in private module namespaces, with a regression that snapshots all exported Batch014 authority values before and after Batch015 imports.\n- Resolver custody truthfully distinguishes 18 conflict-shard paper assignments from 7 safe-lane assignments: 25 assignments, 20 unique papers, and 5 explicitly reported overlaps. It makes no complete-corpus resolver ownership claim.\n- Frozen external paths rebase beneath `CIE9709_BATCH015_EXTERNAL_ROOT`; source and file hashes remain strict.\n- The authenticated supersession namespace is validated after generic frozen-suffix rebasing, and a subprocess regression executes the complete finalizer through a temporary alternate root while reproducing the immutable v1 terminal outputs byte-for-byte.\n\nVerification completed:\n\n- `PYTHONPATH=. uv run --no-project --python 3.12 python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1690_import_isolation.test.py -v` — 1 passed\n- `PYTHONPATH=. uv run --no-project --python 3.12 python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1690_pre_provider.test.py -v` — 5 passed\n- `PYTHONPATH=. uv run --no-project --python 3.12 python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1690_reconciliation.test.py -v` — 6 passed\n- `PYTHONPATH=. uv run --no-project --python 3.12 python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1690_final_resolution.test.py -v` — 11 passed, including full alternate-root subprocess and byte-identical publish replay\n- `PYTHONPATH=. uv run --no-project --python 3.12 python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1688_pre_provider.test.py -v` — 6 passed\n- `PYTHONPATH=. uv run --no-project --python 3.12 python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1688_final_resolution.test.py -v` — 8 passed\n- Python compilation for all Batch015 workflow scripts — passed\n- `git diff --check` — passed\n\nTotal: 37 passed (Batch015 23; Batch014 regression 14).\n\nLint workflows that remain pending/cancelled in `actions/checkout` are infrastructure-only under the frozen issue contract; any deterministic repository lint/test/data failure remains blocking.\n\nKey active terminal hashes:\n\n- verification ledger: `08d67cdcaedc8ff344648fecaaf2493a44e9ae0f4b98dd9649324628495013c0`\n- verified staging shard: `a4885cd36d7fdb18c9fbd9e44e53cdc26822cb1331d15b2a2a354f2245d0b9e5`\n- corrected resolver custody: `380009f8e357f408fa0b703d0df283440405438ba31c27ebdad64c357720f867`\n- deterministic reconstruction v3: `171daff89336d1631bea3a482b22c59bf41da273c2cad614c6cc5039d15d285d`\n- artifact manifest v3: `2e44f58e2c5cd2867de5bb50c975897511fd6cad7bbbedce70f9455d14c9f3ce`\n","created_at":"2026-07-23T10:15:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T10:52:03Z","closed_at":"2026-07-23T10:52:03Z","merged_at":"2026-07-23T10:52:03Z","merge_commit_sha":"4f7ff04257fc1ae110aa0473a41c1a4c85b53197","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1691/commits","review_comments_url":"ht